{% comment %}
  Home-Gym-Konfigurator mit Mo — Men's Health / Women's Health cooperation.

  The landing page of the cooperation: hero with the partner seals, the
  configurator (left, ≤ 50 %) and Mo docked next to it (right). The visitor
  picks a few basics („Welcher Typ bist du? / Trainingsort & Platz / Training
  & Niveau“), „Weiter – Mo berät mich“ hands them to Mo
  (window.MS_CHAT.configurator.start of ms-chat-widget.js), Mo asks for budget
  and wishes with answer chips and builds the plan; the editable plan appears
  on the left with one „Alles in den Warenkorb“.

  Look: the backend's „Performance“ e-mail design (mo repo,
  src/lib/email-designs/performance.ts) — everything on white, light-blue
  accent, red main CTA, black outline secondary buttons, bordered cards.
  The shared --hgk-* tokens are defined on .ms-hgk (…configurator.css).

  Hosts the widget fills (contract in ms-chat-widget.js → Home-Gym-Konfigurator):
    [data-ms-chat-dock]  the docked chat panel (intro below until the handover)
    [data-ms-chat-plan]  the editable plan (data-state: empty | waiting | ready)
  Page logic: assets/ms-home-gym-configurator.js, styles: …configurator.css.
  Answer ids are the backend's vocabulary (mo repo, src/lib/configurator-core.mjs);
  the personas are Mo's own customer personas.

  Promotional links can preselect answers and the partner:
    ?partner=mh|wh  (or utm_source containing menshealth / womenshealth)
    ?persona=strength_focused&location=house&space=xs&level=rookie&training=free_weights,cardio
    (persona aliases typ/type/fokus/focus/target/ziel; level aliases skills/niveau;
     ort → location, platz → space; a value may also be the option's position,
     e.g. target=01 = the first persona; old persona/goal ids still map)
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'ms-home-gym-configurator.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign hgk_en = false
  if request.locale.iso_code == 'en'
    assign hgk_en = true
  endif
  assign hgk_mo_on = false
  if settings.ai_advisor_enabled and settings.ms_chat_shared_secret != blank
    assign hgk_mo_on = true
  endif
  assign hgk_seals = false
  if section.settings.seal_mh != blank or section.settings.seal_wh != blank
    assign hgk_seals = true
  endif
  assign hgk_fallback = section.settings.fallback_url | default: '/pages/angebotsanfrage'
-%}

<section
  class="ms-hgk"
  id="ms-hgk-{{ section.id }}"
  data-ms-hgk
  data-locale="{% if hgk_en %}en{% else %}de{% endif %}"
  data-partner="{{ section.settings.partner }}"
  data-mo="{% if hgk_mo_on %}on{% else %}off{% endif %}"
  data-fallback-url="{{ hgk_fallback }}"
>
  {%- comment -%} ---------- Hero ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-hero{% if section.settings.hero_image != blank %} ms-hgk-hero--image{% endif %}{% if hgk_seals %} ms-hgk-hero--seals{% endif %}">
    <div class="ms-hgk-wrap ms-hgk-hero__inner">
      <div class="ms-hgk-hero__copy">
        {%- if section.settings.hero_intro != blank -%}
          <p class="ms-hgk-hero__intro">{{ section.settings.hero_intro | escape | replace: ' – ', '&nbsp;– ' | newline_to_br }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h1 class="ms-hgk-hero__title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
        <div class="ms-hgk-hero__actions">
          <a class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--red ms-hgk-btn--lg" href="#ms-hgk-start-{{ section.id }}" data-ms-hgk-scroll>
            {{ section.settings.hero_cta | default: 'Jetzt Home Gym planen' | escape }}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- if hgk_seals -%}
        <div class="ms-hgk-seals ms-hgk-hero__seals">
          <div class="ms-hgk-seals__row">
            {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
              <div class="ms-hgk-seal" data-partner-seal="mh">
                {{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 520 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '260, 400, 520', sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 220px, 180px' }}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
              <div class="ms-hgk-seal" data-partner-seal="wh">
                {{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 520 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '260, 400, 520', sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 220px, 180px' }}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if section.settings.seal_caption != blank -%}
            <p class="ms-hgk-seals__caption">{{ section.settings.seal_caption | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.hero_image != blank -%}
        <div class="ms-hgk-hero__media">
          {{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 40vw, 100vw', widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1600', alt: '' }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Small seals for the header of the „Welcher Typ bist du?“ card (cloned by the page JS). {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if hgk_seals -%}
    <template data-ms-hgk-seals-small>
      {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
        <span class="ms-hgk-miniseal" data-partner-seal="mh">{{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '60, 120', sizes: '48px' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
        <span class="ms-hgk-miniseal" data-partner-seal="wh">{{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '60, 120', sizes: '48px' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </template>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} ---------- Configurator stage ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-stage" id="ms-hgk-start-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
      <ol class="ms-hgk-steps" data-ms-hgk-steps aria-label="{% if hgk_en %}Progress{% else %}Fortschritt{% endif %}">
        <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item is-current" data-step="start"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__num">1</span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Your basics{% else %}Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span></li>
        <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="questions"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__num">2</span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Mo asks{% else %}Anforderungen{% endif %}</span></li>
        <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="plan"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__num">3</span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Your plan{% else %}Empfehlung{% endif %}</span></li>
        <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="cart"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__num">4</span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Done{% else %}Fertig{% endif %}</span></li>
      </ol>

      <div class="ms-hgk-grid">
        <div class="ms-hgk-left">
          <form class="ms-hgk-form" data-ms-hgk-form novalidate>
            <div class="ms-hgk-form__groups" data-ms-hgk-groups>
              <noscript><p class="ms-hgk-note">{% if hgk_en %}Please enable JavaScript to use the configurator.{% else %}Bitte aktiviere JavaScript, um den Konfigurator zu nutzen.{% endif %}</p></noscript>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-hgk-form__footer">
              <p class="ms-hgk-form__hint" data-ms-hgk-hint aria-live="polite"></p>
              <button type="submit" class="ms-hgk-cta" data-ms-hgk-cta disabled>
                <span data-ms-hgk-cta-label>{% if hgk_en %}Next – Mo advises me{% else %}Weiter – Mo berät mich{% endif %}</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-link" data-ms-hgk-cancel hidden>{% if hgk_en %}Cancel{% else %}Abbrechen{% endif %}</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="ms-hgk-profile" data-ms-hgk-profile hidden>
            <div class="ms-hgk-profile__head">
              <p class="ms-hgk-profile__title">{% if hgk_en %}Your answers{% else %}Deine Angaben{% endif %}</p>
              <div class="ms-hgk-profile__actions">
                <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-link" data-ms-hgk-edit>{% if hgk_en %}Change{% else %}Ändern{% endif %}</button>
                <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-link" data-ms-hgk-restart>{% if hgk_en %}Start over{% else %}Neu starten{% endif %}</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="ms-hgk-chips" data-ms-hgk-chips role="list"></ul>
          </div>

          <div class="ms-hgk-plan" data-ms-chat-plan data-state="empty">
            <div class="ms-hgk-plan__waiting">
              <span class="ms-hgk-plan__pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="ms-hgk-plan__title">{% if hgk_en %}Your home-gym plan{% else %}Dein Home-Gym-Plan{% endif %}</p>
                <p class="ms-hgk-plan__text">{% if hgk_en %}Answer Mo's questions – your plan with every product, price and total appears right here.{% else %}Beantworte Mos Fragen – dein Plan mit allen Produkten, Preisen und der Gesamtsumme erscheint genau hier.{% endif %}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-hgk-right">
          <div class="ms-hgk-dock" data-ms-chat-dock>
            <div class="ms-hgk-intro" data-ms-hgk-intro>
              <span class="ms-chat-logo ms-hgk-intro__orb" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <p class="ms-hgk-intro__title">{{ section.settings.mo_title | escape }}</p>
              <p class="ms-hgk-intro__text">{{ section.settings.mo_intro | escape }}</p>
              <ul class="ms-hgk-intro__list" role="list">
                <li>{% if hgk_en %}I only ask what really matters{% else %}Ich frage nur, was wirklich zählt{% endif %}</li>
                <li>{% if hgk_en %}Your set – matched to space, goal and budget{% else %}Dein Set – passend zu Platz, Ziel und Budget{% endif %}</li>
                <li>{% if hgk_en %}Everything into the cart with one click{% else %}Alles mit einem Klick in den Warenkorb{% endif %}</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="ms-hgk-intro__hint" data-ms-hgk-intro-hint>
                <span class="ms-hgk-intro__hint-wide">{% if hgk_en %}← Pick your basics on the left{% else %}← Wähle links deine Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="ms-hgk-intro__hint-narrow">{% if hgk_en %}↑ Pick your basics above{% else %}↑ Wähle oben deine Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span>
              </p>
              <p class="ms-hgk-intro__fallback" data-ms-hgk-fallback hidden>
                {%- if hgk_en -%}Mo is not available right now.{%- else -%}Mo ist gerade nicht erreichbar.{%- endif %}
                <a href="{{ hgk_fallback }}">{% if hgk_en %}Ask our team instead{% else %}Frag stattdessen unser Team{% endif %}</a>
              </p>
              <p class="ms-hgk-intro__legal">{% if hgk_en %}AI fitness advisor · free and without obligation{% else %}KI-Fitnessberater · kostenlos & unverbindlich{% endif %}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- How it works ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-how" id="ms-hgk-how-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
      <h2 class="ms-hgk-band"><span>{% if hgk_en %}How it works{% else %}So funktioniert’s{% endif %}</span></h2>
      <ol class="ms-hgk-how__list" role="list">
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">1</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Pick your basics{% else %}Grundeinstellungen wählen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Your training focus, place, space and level – a few clicks.{% else %}Dein Trainingsfokus, Ort, Platz und Niveau – ein paar Klicks.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">2</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Talk to Mo{% else %}Mit Mo sprechen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Mo asks about budget and wishes – tap an answer or write freely.{% else %}Mo fragt nach Budget und Wünschen – Antwort antippen oder frei schreiben.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">3</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Get your plan{% else %}Plan bekommen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Your set with matching accessories – adjust it and add everything to the cart.{% else %}Dein Set mit passendem Zubehör – anpassen und alles in den Warenkorb legen.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- Partners ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.coop_heading != blank or section.settings.partners_text != blank -%}
    <div class="ms-hgk-coop">
      <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
        {%- if section.settings.partners_label != blank -%}
          <p class="ms-hgk-band"><span>{{ section.settings.partners_label | escape }}</span></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="ms-hgk-coop__inner{% if hgk_seals %} ms-hgk-coop__inner--seals{% endif %}">
          {%- if hgk_seals -%}
            <div class="ms-hgk-coop__seals ms-hgk-seals__row">
              {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
                <div class="ms-hgk-seal ms-hgk-seal--lg" data-partner-seal="mh">{{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 520 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '260, 400, 520', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 230px, 160px' }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
                <div class="ms-hgk-seal ms-hgk-seal--lg" data-partner-seal="wh">{{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 520 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '260, 400, 520', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 230px, 160px' }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="ms-hgk-coop__copy">
            {%- if section.settings.coop_heading != blank -%}<h2 class="ms-hgk-h2">{{ section.settings.coop_heading | escape }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.partners_text != blank -%}<div class="ms-hgk-coop__text">{{ section.settings.partners_text }}</div>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.coop_link != blank and section.settings.coop_link_label != blank -%}
              <a class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--outline" href="{{ section.settings.coop_link }}">{{ section.settings.coop_link_label | escape }}</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

<script src="{{ 'ms-home-gym-configurator.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home-Gym-Konfigurator",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-ms-hgk",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Konfigurator mit Mo: links die Grundeinstellungen (Typ, Ort & Platz, Training & Niveau), rechts berät Mo und stellt den Home-Gym-Plan zusammen. Mo nutzt dafür das Konfigurator-Sortiment (Shopify-Tag „home-gym-konfigurator“, einstellbar im Mo-Backend unter Konfigurator). Mo muss unter Theme-Einstellungen → AI Advisor aktiv sein."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "partner",
      "label": "Partner dieser Landingpage",
      "info": "Wird in den Kennzahlen als Herkunft gezählt und setzt das Siegel des Partners nach vorn. Ein Link mit ?partner=mh oder ?partner=wh überschreibt die Einstellung.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "Beide / keiner" },
        { "value": "mh", "label": "Men's Health" },
        { "value": "wh", "label": "Women's Health" }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Kopfbereich" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "hero_intro", "label": "Einleitung über der Überschrift", "default": "In wenigen Schritten dein Home Gym konfigurieren – mit persönlicher KI-Beratung von Mo." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Überschrift", "info": "Ab Tablet-Breite einzeilig – kurz halten.", "default": "Dein Home Gym. Klar geplant." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_cta", "label": "Button", "default": "Jetzt Home Gym planen" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Bild (optional)", "info": "Hell, ohne Abdunklung: auf großen Bildschirmen rechts neben dem Text, sonst darunter. Querformat, mind. 1600 px breit." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Empfehlungssiegel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_caption", "label": "Text zu den Siegeln", "default": "Unser Konfigurator trägt das Empfehlungssiegel Men's und Women's Health." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "seal_mh", "label": "Siegel Men's Health", "info": "PNG mit transparentem Hintergrund, quadratisch, mind. 520 px. Erscheint im Kopfbereich, klein bei „Welcher Typ bist du?“ und bei den Partnern." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_mh_alt", "label": "Alternativtext Men's Health", "default": "Empfehlungssiegel Men's Health" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "seal_wh", "label": "Siegel Women's Health", "info": "PNG mit transparentem Hintergrund, quadratisch, mind. 520 px." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_wh_alt", "label": "Alternativtext Women's Health", "default": "Empfehlungssiegel Women's Health" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Mo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mo_title", "label": "Begrüßung", "default": "Hallo, ich bin Mo – dein Home-Gym-Berater." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "mo_intro", "label": "Einleitung", "default": "Wähle ein paar Grundeinstellungen – dann übernehme ich: Ich frage kurz nach Budget und Wünschen und stelle dir dein passendes Home Gym zusammen." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "fallback_url", "label": "Link, falls Mo nicht erreichbar ist", "info": "Leer = /pages/angebotsanfrage" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Starke Partner" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "partners_label", "label": "Überschrift des Bereichs", "default": "Starke Partner" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "coop_heading", "label": "Titel", "default": "motion sports × Men's Health & Women's Health" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "partners_text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Ob Einsteiger, ambitionierter Home-Athlet oder professioneller Kraftsportler – jeder Mensch trainiert anders und hat individuelle Ansprüche. Deshalb entwickeln wir gemeinsam mit dir dein persönliches Home Gym: mit erstklassigem Fitness-Equipment, professioneller Beratung und Lösungen, die perfekt zu deinen Zielen, deinem Platzangebot und deinem Alltag passen.</p><p>Auch Men’s Health und Women’s Health vertrauen auf unsere Expertise und empfehlen motion sports als Partner für die individuelle Home-Gym-Planung. Denn uns verbindet die Überzeugung, dass erfolgreiches Training zu Hause mit einer persönlichen Beratung und der richtigen Ausstattung beginnt. Gemeinsam möchten wir dir helfen, das Beste aus deinem Home Gym herauszuholen.</p><p>Und so einfach geht’s: Du verrätst uns, wie du trainieren möchtest und was dir wichtig ist. Mo, unser KI-Fitnessberater, unterstützt dich dabei, dein individuelles Home Gym zusammenzustellen. Dabei stehen wir dir jederzeit auch persönlich zur Seite – online oder direkt in unserem Showroom bei München.</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "coop_link_label", "label": "Link-Text (optional)" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "coop_link", "label": "Link (optional)" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Home-Gym-Konfigurator" }]
}
{% endschema %}
